scoreboard players add Attempts Diamond_Shovel 1
summon villager ~ ~-4 ~ {VillagerData: {profession: toolsmith, level: 4}, NoAI: 1b, NoGravity: 1b, Silent: 1b, Invulnerable: 1b, Tags: ["diamond_shovel"]}

